 come home  whatever it looks like does it look like  partnering up with her on how you can  better help at home and you're gonna  find someone else to pick up your slack  at work whatever it looks like get with  your wife and create a detailed plan of  what reentry looks like Scott you're a  good man I'm proud of you for doing the  hard work for being brave and now it's  time to do the most brave thing which is  to be vulnerable and whole at home to  love your wife to be a good partner love  your baby girl be a good dad and then to  draw up new plans for what tomorrow's  gonna look like go get them Scott this  is dr. John Delaney with Ramsey Network  take care  subscribe tell your friends to email me  at ask John at Ramsey solutions comm and  I'll see you soon  take care

